        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<div style=\"background:#05060f;min-height:88vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;padding:2vw;box-sizing:border-box;\"><div style=\"font-size:4.5vw;font-weight:bold;color:#7fe9ff;letter-spacing:0.3vw;margin:1.2vw 0;\">TRAINEE, WELCOME ABOARD.</div><div style=\"font-size:2.6vw;color:#39ff88;line-height:1.5;margin:0.9vw 0;\">You have completed your training at the Space Academy.</div><div style=\"font-size:2.6vw;color:#39ff88;line-height:1.5;margin:0.9vw 0;\">But graduation is not the end.</div><div style=\"font-size:3.4vw;font-weight:bold;color:#ffd23f;letter-spacing:0.3vw;margin:1.2vw 0;\">It is the beginning.</div><div style=\"font-size:2.6vw;color:#39ff88;line-height:1.5;margin:0.9vw 0;\">Before you can be promoted to the next rank, you must prove that you are ready to operate as a real member of the crew.</div><div style=\"font-size:2.8vw;color:#7fe9ff;line-height:1.5;margin:0.9vw 0;\">Your final exam begins now.</div></div>",
